From elyograg@wolsi.com Sun Jun 20 15:34:05 1999
Message-ID: <4.1.19990619151810.00a01150@mail.wolsi.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Jun 1999 15:31:05 -0600
From: elyograg <elyograg@wolsi.com>
Subject: Re: strange memory allocation
