        Ehh, not hardly!

        IA32 = little endian, 32 bit words

        Alpha = big endian, 64 bit words

        Sparc = big endian, 32 bit words

        Sparc64 = big endian, 64 bit words

        Mips = bi-endian, not sure about word length. Yeah, my Magnum 4000 can

